port":{"artifact_id":11592862113,"candidate":{"bundle_sha256":"71be58c6058c0eb22ee4669d0220b44028300b3b40dbedc041149b251d1a9b8c","changed":true,"changed_paths":["instrumentation/aws-lambda/aws-lambda-events-common-2.2/library/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/awslambdaevents/common/v2_2/internal/SqsEventSpanLinksExtractor.java","instrumentation/aws-lambda/aws-lambda-events-common-2.2/library/src/test/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/awslambdaevents/common/v2_2/internal/SqsEventSpanLinksExtractorTest.java"],"commit":"e697e8bfa22298cbe84b1d7cbe887162cc601b50","commits":[{"changed_paths":["instrumentation/aws-lambda/aws-lambda-events-common-2.2/library/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/awslambdaevents/common/v2_2/internal/SqsEventSpanLinksExtractor.java","instrumentation/aws-lambda/aws-lambda-events-common-2.2/library/src/test/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/awslambdaevents/common/v2_2/internal/SqsEventSpanLinksExtractorTest.java"],"commit":"e697e8bfa22298cbe84b1d7cbe887162cc601b50","parent":"7bd0ef177a93235c6283904ebb6b9e8c555ac265","patch_sha256":"ac54ae04861546e188d343729cf60376957405c8e112b0e1b44851fb6b1e0e4d","subject":"Address Copilot review comments: Skip empty invalid SQS span links","tree":"31a3c18e812ae7274d50cb4bb2f7d244928f4cba"}],"cumulative_patch_sha256":"ac54ae04861546e188d343729cf60376957405c8e112b0e1b44851fb6b1e0e4d","finding_commits":{"inline:4226103699":"e697e8bfa22298cbe84b1d7cbe887162cc601b50","review:5465103381":"e697e8bfa22298cbe84b1d7cbe887162cc601b50"},"parent":"7bd0ef177a93235c6283904ebb6b9e8c555ac265","patch_sha256":"ac54ae04861546e188d343729cf60376957405c8e112b0e1b44851fb6b1e0e4d","tree":"31a3c18e812ae7274d50cb4bb2f7d244928f4cba"},"dispositions":{"batches":[{"analysis":"The frozen extractor unconditionally delegates every record. A missing message ID in a shared queue yields empty link attributes and an invalid context when no trace header exists. Delegate only when the context is valid or its computed attributes are nonempty. Add regression coverage for skipping that case while preserving valid empty links and invalid links carrying message IDs or varying destinations.","downsides":"Adds a validity/emptiness condition per record and intentionally stops forwarding invalid links with no attributes.","findings":["review:5465103381","inline:4226103699"],"length":6155,"offset":0,"sha256":"ac54ae04861546e188d343729cf60376957405c8e112b0e1b44851fb6b1e0e4d","summary":"Skip empty invalid SQS span links","upsides":"Prevents custom span builders from recording empty invalid links while preserving valid contexts and attributed invalid links."}],"findings":[{"analysis":"The complete review body and expanded details describe the same empty-invalid-link defect as the inline finding. The new condition rejects untraced shared-queue records without message IDs, whose computed link attributes are empty. The regression fails on the frozen extractor and passes with the fix.","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"Only invalid links without attributes stop reaching the configured span builder.","key":"review:5465103381","upsides":"Addresses the body finding without inventing another thread or altering valid or attributed links."},{"analysis":"SqsEventRecordAttributesTest confirms that a missing message ID in a shared queue produces Attributes.empty(), and SpanLinksBuilderImpl delegates directly to the configured SpanBuilder. Guarding addLink with context validity or nonempty computed attributes fixes the issue at the extractor, independent of SDK filtering. Focused tests cover rejection and both preservation conditions.","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"Adds one conditional check per record; the only removed delegation is an invalid context with empty attributes.","key":"inline:4226103699","upsides":"Makes the empty-invalid-link behavior consistent for SDK and non-SDK builders while retaining all meaningful links."}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"5147517caa5191f710a92d5be03649bf17324cf9a734af5a20b77f3b1174f8a7","schema":2},"download_sha256":"94391151a2799a82dff2aac0af8c9a386f2a77fdc3f3e200a7ff7524c5613d2d","frozen_sha":"7bd0ef177a93235c6283904ebb6b9e8c555ac265","pr":20463,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"5147517caa5191f710a92d5be03649bf17324cf9a734af5a20b77f3b1174f8a7","request_id":"e8c68f528a6f40ac958c8f7cbf944d27","run_attempt":1,"run_id":37875709047,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:94391151a2799a82dff2aac0af8c9a386f2a77fdc3f3e200a7ff7524c5613d2d","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":37877394323},"workflow_revision":"eeb2844fe52587fca7818e45b1308beb49aed0bc"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5463166557,5465103381],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nThe Lambda extractor can forward an empty invalid link when a message ID is absent.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Avoid forwarding empty invalid links](#discussion_r4226103699) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5465103381","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5465103381},{"body":"[General] This also forwards an empty invalid link for the supported case where a record has no message ID and all records share one queue: `getLinkAttributes()` returns `Attributes.empty()` for that case (`SqsEventRecordAttributesTest.java:89-95`). Because `SpanLinksBuilder` delegates to the configured `SpanBuilder`, dropping this link is implementation-dependent, so a non-SDK implementation may record the empty invalid link despite this change being scoped to attributed links. Preserve valid links, but only forward invalid contexts when the computed attributes are nonempty.","comment_commit_id":"7bd0ef177a93235c6283904ebb6b9e8c555ac265","comment_id":4226103699,"key":"inline:4226103699","kind":"inline","line":30,"original_commit_id":"7bd0ef177a93235c6283904ebb6b9e8c555ac265","original_line":30,"path":"instrumentation/aws-lambda/aws-lambda-events-common-2.2/library/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/awslambdaevents/common/v2_2/internal/SqsEventSpanLinksExtractor.java","review_commit_id":"7bd0ef177a93235c6283904ebb6b9e8c555ac265","review_id":5465103381,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-09T02:38:39Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"f07ab5be5830c77897c921b2492b274e1a096cae984a3dd21da8b85b4f76721c","id":4226103699,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T02:38:39Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86qoD2g"}],"frozen_at":1791513625,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-09T02:40:25Z","frozen_sha":"7bd0ef177a93235c6283904ebb6b9e8c555ac265","head_ref":"trask-invalid-span-links-d0f","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37875666687},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","mode":"publish","pr":20463,"protocol":"reviewable-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at